<title>UK: Total SA prices $300 mln seven-year bond.</title>
<headline>Total SA prices $300 mln seven-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced earlier by lead manager Morgan Stanley, has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   TOTAL SA</p>
<p> AMT    $300 MLN	COUPON     6.875     MATURITY    02.JUN.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.266   PAY DATE    02.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.691    SPREAD	+33 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/FR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.20	SELL CONC  1.675     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
